Package: pdua
Version: 1.2.10
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: proton-drive
Maintainer: Scott <developer.on.opensource@unixinbox.com>
Description: GUI utility for the Proton Drive CLI
 Unofficial GTK4 frontend wrapping the native Proton Drive
 command-line client for uploads, downloads and album browsing.
